If you end up on the wrong altar on Astral you might be best off
wishing for a helm of opposite alignment with the wrest.
One of my favorite wishes is a blessed cockatrice corpse but since you
have only one wish remaining perhaps you should use up all of the
wands/scrolls of create monster to try and get a cockatrice right
before you enter Earth.  That'll save you some grief for at least a
couple hundred turns.
